### ContractCustomers  - Get All ContractCustomers
GET http://{{host}}{{service}}/ContractCustomers
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t


### ContractCustomers  - Get Contract by ID - ODATA V2
GET http://{{host}}{{service}}/ContractCustomers(guid'f6df5ef6-ee78-11ed-a05b-0242ac120003')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t

###ContractCustomers  - Create new Contract
POST http://{{host}}{{service}}/ContractCustomers
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "BHOID"     : "test2 value",
    "Name"      : "test2 name",
    "ContractID": "e88f4e1d-9ce0-4f57-846d-a9630463ea63",
    "IsParent"  : false
}

###ContractCustomers  - Update Contract
PUT http://{{host}}{{service}}/ContractCustomers(guid'e88f4e1d-9ce0-4f57-846d-a9630463ea63')
Authorization: Basic YXJ0aW9t
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "BHOID"     : "test value",
    "Name"      : "test name",
    "ContractID": "e88f4e1d-9ce0-4f57-846d-a9630463ea63",
    "IsParent"  : false
}

### ContractCustomers  - Delete contract by ID
